        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruac Thi-bɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t Thi-bɛn thiec i̱, “Ɛn ruac ɛmɛ ɛ thuɔ̱k?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thi-bɛn ɛ loc i̱, “Dämaari, kɛ yɛn gua̱a̱ri, liɛŋɛ ruacdä. Kuoth in buɔy cɛ rɔ nyuɔ̱th gua̱ndɔɔŋdan ni A-bɛ-ram mëë tëë kä Mɛ-tho-po-ta-mia a ŋot /kenɛ ni cieŋ kä Ɣa-ran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth ɛ jiök i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tuk 12:1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Bänyni ro̱lu kɛnɛ watku piny, kä wër ro̱o̱l in bä nyuɔ̱th ji̱.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jiɛɛn ro̱o̱l Kɛ̈l-da-ya, cuɛ wä cieŋ kä Ɣa-ran. Kɛ kɔr kä mëë ci gua̱n li̱w, cu Kuoth ɛ nööŋ ro̱o̱l ɛ ta̱yɛ thi̱n ɛ täämɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thilɛ gua̱a̱th mi ci Kuoth ɛ ka̱m jɛ a cäŋɛ ni käth cio̱kä. Kä cu Kuoth ɛ la̱r ɣöö bɛ jɛ ka̱m mun ɛmɛ ala duŋdɛ amäni kuaykɛ, a cäŋɛ mëë thilɛ jɛ gat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth ruac kɛ jɛ kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p ɛmɛ, ɛn ɣöö bi kuaykɛ a jur ro̱o̱l nɛɛni kɔ̱kiɛn, ti bakɛ yak kä bakɛ ciɛŋ a jiäk kɛ run ti kur ŋuaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tuk 13-14, Ɣöth 3:12.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Ɣän bä do̱r in lätkɛ thi̱n ala kuaany luk. Kä kɛ kɔrɛ bikɛ ben raar kä bikɛ ɣä ben pal ɛn wanɛ mɛ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth ruac mat kɛnɛ A-bɛ-ram ɛn ɣöö bakɛ cuɛl. Kä ɛnɔ cu A-bɛ-ram a gua̱n Ay-dhɛk, kä cuɛ jɛ cuɛl ɛ tekɛ ni̱n kɛ bädäk ni̱n. Kä cu Ay-dhɛk a gua̱n Je-kɔb, kä cu Je-kɔb a gua̱n gua̱ndɔɔŋni da̱ŋ wäl rɛw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä cu gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn tekɛ tiɛɛl kɛ Jo-thɛp, kä cukɛ jɛ kök ji̱ I-jëp. Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu Kuoth te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ kän kä rikɛ diaal, kä cuɛ jɛ ka̱m pɛl kɛnɛ nhök nhiam Pɛro kuäär ji̱ I-jëp in di̱i̱t. Mëë cu jɛ jakä kuäär kä I-jëp kɛnɛ ji̱ dhɔaarɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, cu buɔth te kä I-jëp kɛnɛ Kɛ-naan, kä cuɛ a riɛk mi di̱i̱t, kä cu gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn thil mi camkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Je-kɔb ɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö bɛl a kä I-jëp, cuɛ gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn ja̱k kɛ jio̱lɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ wä in rɛwdɛ cu Jo-thɛp rɔ nyuɔ̱th dämani, kä cua ji̱ gɔaal Jo-thɛp ŋa̱c ɛ Pɛro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jo-thɛp raan ja̱k kɛ ɣöö ba gua̱n ni Je-kɔb wä nöŋ jɛ kɛnɛ ji̱ maarädɛ diaal ti jiɛn bärɔw wi̱cdɛ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Je-kɔb wä kä I-jëp. Kä cuɛ li̱w ɛn wani, amäni gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cua pua̱nykiɛn luɔ̱ɔ̱c kä Cɛ-kɛm, kä cua kɛ kony guäth mëë ci A-bɛ-ram ɛ kɔk kɛ yio̱w kä gaat Ɣa-mor kä Cɛ-kɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mëë ci gua̱a̱th ku thia̱k kɛ ɣöö bi Kuoth mëë cɛ la̱r A-bɛ-ram la̱t, cu nɛɛkɔn rɔ̱ rep ɛlɔ̱ŋ kä I-jëp, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amäni mëë ci kuäär dɔ̱diɛn mi kui̱c Jo-thɛp ben kä I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ca̱p la̱t ɛ wän wän kɛ do̱ran, kä cuɛ gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn kuɔ̱k ɣöö ba ruɔrikiɛn ba̱ny raar, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th ɛmɔ cua Muthɛ dap, kä gɔaaɛ nhiam Kuɔth. Kä cua jɛ luëëth kɛ päth da̱ŋ diɔ̱k dueel gua̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca jɛ ba̱ny raar, cu nya Pɛro ɛ kuany kä cuɛ jɛ rɔm ce̱tkɛ gatdɛ pa̱ny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua Muthɛ ŋi̱eec kɛ pɛl ji̱ I-jëp diaal, kä cuɛ bum kɛ ruac kɛnɛ lätkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mëë cɛ tekɛ run ti jiɛn ŋuan, cuɛ ben lɔaacdɛ ɛn ɣöö bɛ ji̱ maarädɛ ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wä gui̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ raan I-thɛ-rɛl kɛl nɛn a la̱tkɛ jɛ a jiäk, cuɛ jɛ ɣɔr kä ram in yaak jɛ, kä cuɛ jɛ col kɛ näk ran I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ car i̱ bi dämani jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö bi Kuoth kɛ kän kɛ tetdɛ. Kä duundɛ ɣöö /ken kɛn ɛ ŋa̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ruɔ̱n cuɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl da̱ŋ rɛw nɛn gakɛ, kä cuɛ go̱r ɛn ɣöö bɛ kɛ rëëc, kä cuɛ wee i̱, ‘Wutni, lapɛ gaat raam kɛl. Ɛŋu ciaŋɛ rɔ̱ a jiäk ɔ?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ram min lät däman a jiäk Muthɛ ɣɔk wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:27-29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣöth 2:13-15.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Ɛŋa mi ci ji̱ jakä rueec kä luuk kä kɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go̱o̱ri ɣöö bi ɣä näk ce̱tkɛ mëë ci raan I-jëp näk pan?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Muthɛ nɔmɔ liŋ cuɛ rɔ bar, kä cuɛ wä cieŋ ala juɔ̱r kä Mid-yan. Ɛn wi̱ni cuɛ gaat da̱ŋ rɛw wä di̱eth thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Täämɛ mëë ci run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ ŋuan thuuk, cu jääk nhial päl kä Muthɛ däär dɔaar, Pääm Thi-nay kɛ bo̱l maac mi pɛt rɛy butbutdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Muthɛ jɛ nɛn cuɛ ga̱a̱c kɛ nëndɛ, kä mëë cɛ rɔ ti̱ec thi̱n kɛ ɣöö bɛ jɛ guic, cu jɔw Kua̱r ni Kuoth ben wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣöth 3:6.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ɛ ɣän Kuoth guuri, Kuoth A-bɛ-ram, kɛnɛ Ay-dhɛk, kɛ Je-kɔb.’ Kä cuɛ Muthɛ lath kɛ dual kɛ guecdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuäär ni Kuoth Muthɛ jiök i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:33-34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣöth 3:5,7,8a,10a.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Woc wa̱a̱ri ciökniku kɛ ɣöö ɛn gua̱a̱th ɛ cuŋi thi̱n ɛ rɛlɛ rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä yaak nɛɛnikä tin te kä I-jëp nɛn ɛpuc, kä cä pa̱riɛn liŋ, kä cä ben piny kɛ ɣöö bäkɛ ben luäk. Bër täämɛ, bä ji̱ jäk kä I-jëp.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛn Muthɛ ɛmɛ ɛ jɛn mëë ca kɔŋ lo̱k ɛ kɛn, mëë ɛ kɛn i̱, ‘Ɛŋa mi ci ji̱ jakä rueec kä luuk?’ Ci Kuoth ɛ ja̱k ala rueec kɛnɛ kään kɛ luäk jääkä nhial mëë ci päl kä jɛ rɛy butbutdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl böth raar, mëë cɛ nyuuthni kɛnɛ ti ga̱ykɛ naath la̱t kä I-jëp kɛnɛ Bar in Tith, kɛ därdɔaar kɛ run ti jiɛn ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn Muthɛ ɛmɛ ɛn nëë jio̱k ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:37",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t 18:15.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Bi Kuoth yɛ jäk kä gök rɛy dämuɔɔri ce̱tkɛ mëë cɛ ɣä jak.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn ram mëë te rɛy bunä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl däär dɔaar kɛnɛ jääk nhial ëë ruac kɛ jɛ Pääm Thi-nay, kɛɛl kɛ gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn kɛɛl, kä cuɛ ŋuɔ̱t teekä jek kä Kuoth kɛ ɣöö bɛ kɛ ka̱m kɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn ruacdɛ lo̱k, kä cukɛ jɛ ɣɔak gekä, kä cukɛ go̱r ni mi lockɛ kä I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ Ä-ron jiök i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:40",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣöth 32:1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Lätni kɔn kuth ti ba kɔn bo̱th, kä ɛn Muthɛ ɛmɛ mëë bo̱th kɔn raar muun I-jëp, kueckɔ mɔ ci tuɔɔk kä jɛ mɔ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cukɛ ruath täth ala Kuoth, kä cukɛ jɛ thöp muc, kä cu lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth kɛ min ca la̱t kɛ tetkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth loc jɔk kä kɛ, kä cuɛ kɛ pa̱l ɣöö palkɛ nyin nhial, ce̱tkɛ min ca gɔ̱r rɛy buɔk göökni i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:42-43",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "A-mɔth 5:25-27.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn tekɛ kɛɛl kɛ kɛmɛ Kuɔth däär dɔaar. Kä ca jɛ la̱t ce̱tkɛ min ci Kuoth ɛ nyuɔ̱th Muthɛ, cuɛ jɛ la̱t, ce̱tkɛ ta̱a̱ in cɛ nɛn ni jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn jɛ nööŋ kɛɛl kɛ kɛ, kɛ Jɔ-cua, mëë cikɛ mun dööri tëë ci Kuoth kɛ joc nhiamdiɛn ka̱n. Cuɛ te thi̱n amäni ni̱n Dee-bid, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mëë ci nhök Kuɔth jek, kä cuɛ Kuoth thiec kɛ ɣöö bɛ gua̱a̱th cieŋä mi bɛ lät kä Kuoth Je-kɔb jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö ɛ Thɔ-lo-mon ɛn nëë tääth luaak kɛ kui̱dɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Kuoth in Di̱t ni Jɛn /cɛ cieŋ rɛy ti̱ecni ti ca la̱t kɛ tet nath, ce̱tkɛ mëë ca lar ɛ gök i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yɛn nɛy ti bum wuɔ̱thkun, kä /ka̱n cuɛl rɛy lo̱ckun kɛnɛ ji̱thkun li̱eŋ thukni Kuɔth, la yɛn Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ a gɛɛw, ce̱tkɛ mëë la guurikun, a lät. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋa kä göök mi /ken guurikun ɛ moc riɛk? Kä cukɛ nɛy tëë latkɛ ben Raam in Gua̱n Cuŋni näk. Kä täämɛ ci yɛn ɛ kɔak kä cia jɛ näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ yɛn kɛn tëë ci ŋuɔ̱t jek kä ja̱a̱k nhial jek, kä /ken yɛn ɛ käp.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bo̱kni Thi-bɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cikɛ rieet ti̱ti̱ liŋ, cuɛ lo̱ckiɛn waŋ, kä cukɛ lɛckiɛn kac kɛ kui̱ Thi-bɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thi-bɛn thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ, cuɛ nhial guec kä cuɛ buay Kuɔth nɛn, kä te Yecu cuŋä kui̱c cuëëc Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Nɛnɛ, ɣän nɛ̈ɛ̈nä nhial a cɛ rɔ lɛp, kä te Gat Ran cuŋä kui̱c cuëëc Kuɔth!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ji̱thkiɛn kum kä wakɛ kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t, kä cu kɛn diaal ɛ ban nikä kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ yɔ̱a̱c raar rɛy wec, kä cukɛ jɛ bök, kä cu nëën bieynikiɛn la̱th nhiam ŋuɛtdä mi cɔal i̱ Thɔɔl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min bo̱k kɛn Thi-bɛn, cuɛ pal i̱, “Kuäär ni Yecu, käni yiëëdä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ rɔ ka̱m mua̱a̱l, kä cuɛ wak kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t i̱, “Kuäär, /cu duer ɛmɛ kueŋ wi̱i̱diɛn.” Kä mëë cɛ mɛmɛ lar, cuɛ li̱w.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.60"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
